rel X2 y x :- help/sym X2 x y X1 , rel X1 x y.

help/sym (prodcert X3/1 X3/2) x y (prodcert X2/1 X2/2) :- help/sym X3/1 x y X2/1 , help/sym X3/2 x y X2/2.

